1505 0 obj
  << /ActualText (LEMON TREE TECHNOLOGY\nPartnerships \046 Growth\054 Part\055time \174 Remote \174 Mar 2026 \023 Present\nCo\055led outreach that signed 10\053 early DEX venues as partners\054 from first contact through close\056\nResearched liquidity models and market structure to surface openings others walked past\056\nBuilt the landing page\054 pitch decks\054 and partner materials that carried technical and commercial conversations alike\056\n\nTAGO CAPITAL\nBusiness Development\054 Commission \174 Remote \174 Apr 2026 \023 Present\nQualified AI\054 robotics\054 and emerging\055tech prospects\054 turning a noisy market into a focused outreach list\056\nRan prospect research\054 outreach\054 and follow\055up end to end across early commercial conversations\056\nTranslated dense technical services into pitches founders and buyers actually understood\056\n\nDERIVE\056XYZ\nGrowth Marketing \046 Community \174 Remote \174 Formerly Lyra Finance \174 Sep 2024 \023 Feb 2026\nGrew Discord from 15\054000 to 40\054000\053 through the token launch\054 across Discord\054 Telegram\054 and X\056\nProduced Derive\047s first event\072 Traders Breakfast at Coinfest Bali for 100\053 guests\054 owning planning\054 guest experience\054 and on\055site execution\056\nCo\055ran Believe in SomETHing\054 an ecosystem campaign across 430\053 protocols for Ethereum\047s tenth anniversary\054 and produced the aftermovie\056\nLed community comms and design through the Lyra\055to\055Derive rebrand\054 holding messaging steady across every channel\056\nShipped Derive\047s Framer landing page\054 plus campaign assets\054 merch\054 and partner materials for launch\056\n\nBRUCE MEDIA\nSocial Media Intern \174 Melbourne \174 Jul 2023 \023 Dec 2023\nDesigned content and briefs for IWC Schaffhausen\054 AFL\054 Dandenong City SC\054 and FIFA Women\054 across sports and lifestyle accounts\056\nAssisted match\055day productions and interview shoots\054 capturing and publishing live content under tight deadlines\056\nAdapted tone and format to each brand\054 from luxury watchmaking to grassroots football\056\n\nMISURA\nSales \046 Design Consultant \174 Melbourne \174 2018 \023 2022\nSold to high\055end residential clients against an AUD \04480K monthly target\054 closing individual projects averaging \04425K depending on the size of the space furnished\056\nGuided clients across seven European brands\054 using 3D visualisation to lock layouts\054 materials\054 finishes\054 and custom specs\056\nRan full\055cycle sales from discovery through after\055sales\054 and designed showroom layouts balancing product storytelling\054 traffic flow\054 and customer experience\056)
     /K [ 15 ]
